<LegalLayout 
  title="Affiliate Disclosure" 
  description="Affiliate disclosure for Bangladesh Travel Guide, explaining monetization, sponsored links, and partner disclosures."
  lastUpdated="October 18, 2026"
>
  <p>
    Transparency is vital to maintaining visitor trust. This page outlines our commercial relationships and affiliate marketing disclosures in compliance with international consumer guidance standards.
  </p>

  <h2>1. What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
  <p>
    Some links on Bangladesh Travel Guide are affiliate links. This means that if you click on the link and purchase a product or service (such as booking a hotel, purchasing an eSIM, or securing travel insurance), we may receive a small commission from the merchant at no additional cost to you.
  </p>

  <h2>2. How We Select Partners</h2>
  <p>
    We only recommend services and products that genuinely benefit foreign tourists traveling in Bangladesh. We do not accept payment to write positive reviews for inferior products or services that compromise visitor safety or travel comfort.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Identification of Links</h2>
  <p>
    Affiliate links on our platform are explicitly labeled with a "Partner Link" badge or accompanied by a visible disclosure callout near the recommendation. All commercial links utilize search engine compliant attributes (<code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code>).
  </p>
</LegalLayout>